Subject: [PATCH 01987/11362] [conductor] In-process docs for PHASE A1
 (HEADLINE; cross-check the surprising win) -- LEAK-AUDIT the +44pp ARC
 oracle-distinct win. exp4245 won by +0.4423 (CI95 [0.308,0.596]) but positive
 labels = exact match to gold/GAP-4-INDUCED pred_grid and features include
 shape/palette-family + duplicate-counts that could encode candidate ORIGIN
 (induced-program output vs sampled candidate) rather than correctness -- a
 leaked/circular detector would inflate AUROC to ~0.96 and the delta to +44pp
 while NOT being oracle-distinct. AUDIT: (1) train an explicit
 candidate-ORIGIN probe (predict induced-vs-sampled from the features) and
 measure how predictive it is AND whether origin correlates with is_correct
 (the leak signature); (2) RE-RUN the decisive beats-vote gate with
 PROVENANCE-BLIND features (strip every origin-encoding feature, keep only
 genuinely oracle-distinct CONTENT signals: vote-priors, cross-candidate
 agreement, self-consistency margin); report the provenance-blind delta + CI95
 vs the .393 +0.4423. Emit win_survives_provenance_blind BARE bool (delta>0
 AND CI95 excl 0 on provenance-blind features). verifier_is_oracle=false. A
 SURVIVING win is decision-grade; a COLLAPSE (the win was provenance leak) is
 an even MORE important decision-grade negative that STOPS the DiffusionGemma
 scale-up.

